[b]AI Limit - Difficulty Scaling[/b]

Difficulty scaling mod for AI Limit. Pick a preset, drop it in, play.

A MelonLoader mod for [b]AI Limit[/b] that lets you customize game difficulty through presets. Choose from 5 difficulty levels plus a custom preset. Scales monster stats, player stats, crystal drops, and fall death height.

[b]Requirements[/b]

[list]
[*][url=https://melon-loader.com/]MelonLoader[/url] 0.7.3+ installed for AI Limit
[/list]

[b]Installation[/b]

[list]
[*]Download and install MelonLoader for AI Limit if you haven't already
[*]Copy [b]DifficultyScaling.dll[/b] and the [b]DifficultyScaling_cfg/[/b] folder into your game's [b]Mods/[/b] directory:
[/list]

[code]<game>/Mods/
    DifficultyScaling.dll
    DifficultyScaling_cfg/
        config.toml
        Difficulty/
            00_custom/scaling.toml
            01_story/scaling.toml
            02_easy/scaling.toml
            03_normal/scaling.toml
            04_adept/scaling.toml
            05_hard/scaling.toml[/code]

[b]How to Change Difficulty[/b]

Edit [b]DifficultyScaling_cfg/config.toml[/b] and set the [b]difficulty[/b] value:

[code]difficulty = "03_normal"[/code]

Supports preset name or number (case-insensitive):

[list]
[*][b]00[/b] or [b]custom[/b] — Custom (edit the TOML yourself)
[*][b]01[/b] or [b]story[/b] — Story
[*][b]02[/b] or [b]easy[/b] — Easy
[*][b]03[/b] or [b]normal[/b] — Normal
[*][b]04[/b] or [b]adept[/b] — Adept (base game values)
[*][b]05[/b] or [b]hard[/b] — Hard
[/list]

[b]Multi-User (Windows Only)[/b]

If multiple people share the same PC, you can set per-user overrides in [b]config.toml[/b]:

[code]difficulty = "03_normal"

[users]
Alice = "01_story"
Bob = "05_hard"[/code]

The mod detects the Windows username and loads that user's preset. Users not listed fall back to the default.

[b]Preset Values[/b]

[list]
[*][b]Story[/b] — Monster Atk x0.4 | Monster Def x0.4 | Player Atk x1.5 | Player Def x1.2 | Player HP x1.5 | Crystal x1.5 | Fall Height x1.5
[*][b]Easy[/b] — Monster Atk x0.6 | Monster Def x0.6 | Player Atk x1.2 | Player Def x1.2 | Player HP x1.35 | Crystal x1.3 | Fall Height x1.35
[*][b]Normal[/b] — Monster Atk x0.8 | Monster Def x0.85 | Player Atk x1.1 | Player Def x1.1 | Player HP x1.2 | Crystal x1.15 | Fall Height x1.2
[*][b]Adept[/b] — Monster Atk x1.0 | Monster Def x1.0 | Player Atk x1.0 | Player Def x1.0 | Player HP x1.0 | Crystal x1.0 | Fall Height x1.0
[*][b]Hard[/b] — Monster Atk x1.2 | Monster Def x1.25 | Player Atk x0.9 | Player Def x0.9 | Player HP x0.9 | Crystal x0.95 | Fall Height x1.0
[/list]

All multipliers are relative to the base game. [b]Adept[/b] is identical to vanilla.

[b]What Each Setting Does[/b]

[list]
[*][b]Monster Atk[/b] — multiplies damage enemies deal to you
[*][b]Monster Def[/b] — multiplies enemy defense stats (damage reduction, resistances)
[*][b]Player Atk[/b] — multiplies damage you deal to enemies
[*][b]Player Def[/b] — multiplies your defense stats (damage reduction, resistances)
[*][b]Player HP[/b] — multiplies your max HP
[*][b]Crystal[/b] — multiplies crystal drops from enemies
[*][b]Fall Height[/b] — multiplies the height threshold before fall death triggers (does not affect the 15-second void timer)
[/list]

[b]Custom Preset[/b]

Edit [b]DifficultyScaling_cfg/Difficulty/00_custom/scaling.toml[/b] with your own values, then set [b]config.toml[/b] to [b]difficulty = "00"[/b] or [b]difficulty = "custom"[/b]:

[code]monster_attack_multiplier = 0.80
monster_defense_multiplier = 0.85
player_attack_multiplier = 1.05
player_defense_multiplier = 1.05
player_hp_multiplier = 1.2
crystal_multiplier = 1.0
fall_death_height_multiplier = 1.0[/code]

[b]Changelog[/b]

[list]
[*][b]v1.2.6[/b] — Fixed quoted TOML keys breaking Windows per-user difficulty overrides.
[*][b]v1.2.5[/b] — Fixed fall death height scaling. Removed GetDeadHigh patch.
[*][b]v1.2.4[/b] — Migrated to config.toml with Windows multi-user support.
[/list]

[b]Debug Logging[/b]

Add [b]debug = true[/b] to any preset's [b]scaling.toml[/b] to enable verbose logging in the MelonLoader console.

